   self,\n         text: str,\n         *,\n         style: StyleType = \"bold white on blue\",\n         border_style: StyleType = \"blue\",\n         pill: bool = True,\n         icon: Optional[str] = None,\n     ) -> None:\n     ```\n   - When `pill=True`, formats the badge with curved pill borders `( ` ... ` )`.\n   - When `pill=False`, formats with square borders `[ ` ... ` ]`.\n   - If `icon` is provided, includes `icon + \" \" + text`.\n   - Accurately reports cell measurement based on character cell lengths.\n2. In `rich/__init__.py`:\n   - Expose `Badge` in `__all__` and make it importable from the top-level `rich` package.\n3. Verification:\n   - Must comply with project architectural standards and render cleanly when printed standalone or nested inside Tables and Panels.\n   - All existing tests must continue to pass without regressions."}],"timestamp":1794167914225},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm checking the repo for an ADR directory, since AGENTS.md mentions ADRs, and starting to explore from there.\n\n","thinkingSignature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1oYWlrdS01LjUtMjAyNjEwMDd8Y2xhdWRlLW9uLWF3cyJ9"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll start by checking the repo layout, any ADR docs, and the existing `__init__.py`."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_015pg9oPnFdmucisBSrU1PpC","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /app && ls && git status | head -5 && find . -iname \"*adr*\" -not -path \"./.git/*\" | head -20 && ls docs 2>/dev/null; cat rich/__init__.py | head -80"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"openrouter","model":"anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5","usage":{"input":4,"output":196,"cacheRead":4857,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":5057,"cost":{"input":4.0000000000000003e-7,"output":0.000098,"cacheRead":0.000048570000000000004,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00014697,"totalFromProvider":true},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":47},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1794167914256,"providerThinkingLevel":"medium","responseI